      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59715a9e4979f85df8d62ef5|full_name}: As someone who often calls vote-to-kicks, I have no interest in seeing that confirmation screen. It is obvious if the kick has worked, as the annoying person disappears from the room. Maybe if it was some unobtrusive banner that appeared at the bottom of your view then disappeared after a few seconds, it would be bearable, but even then, if given the option, I would opt out of it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
