  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-10-17T23:48:45.692Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This obtrusive window appears any time a vote kick is called to display whether or not the vote kick succeeded. Users are required to click ok on the message to dismiss it, otherwise it obscures their vision and ability to interact with the world. This forces them to drop everything they are doing to dismiss this wholly useless message. I can not think of a single useful reason for this screen to appear, as it not particularly useful information. To make matters worse, these screens are bugged, and will, in some cases, pop-up in a way that refuses to be dismissed for several minutes. Rather than fix these worthless wastes of user interface, I propose that they are removed entirely.",
